# The network of "HTTP/3 for the office": the office, the internet and the
# shop's web server.
#
#   office 192.0.2.10 --- isp --- shop 203.0.113.10
#
# isp stands for the internet between them: 50 ms each way, a 100 ms round
# trip. It is scenery.
machine office
machine isp router
machine shop

link office:eth0=192.0.2.10/24 isp:office=192.0.2.1/24
link isp:shop=203.0.113.1/24 shop:eth0=203.0.113.10/24

route office default via 192.0.2.1
route shop default via 203.0.113.1

netem isp office delay 50ms limit 2000
netem isp shop delay 50ms limit 2000

run shop nftables
